### get_record_fields

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl get_record_fields forall t u. (x : t) : list (string * u) =\n    real\n        real_core.record_type_fold_back\n            fun key =>\n                forall u'. acc =>\n                    inl k = sm'_real.symbol_to_string_real `(`key)\n                    inl v = x key\n                    (::) `(string * u') (k, v) acc\n            `t\n            (Nil `(string * u))","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl get_record_fields forall t u. (x : t) : list (string * u) =
      real
          real_core.record_type_fold_back
              fun key =>
                  forall u'. acc =>
                      inl k = sm'_real.symbol_to_string_real `(`key)
                      inl v = x key
                      (::) `(string * u') (k, v) acc
              `t
              (Nil `(string * u))
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

